WEBVTT

00:12:29.482 --> 00:12:32.544
And for that, these two countries,
these two powerful giants,

00:12:32.568 --> 00:12:35.419
must reduce their own greenhouse gases,

00:12:36.646 --> 00:12:39.475
control their pollution,
and lead the fight.

00:12:41.134 --> 00:12:44.428
Lead the global fight
against climate change.

00:12:45.950 --> 00:12:48.886
And all that with a renewed
sense of urgency.

00:12:48.910 --> 00:12:52.908
Only then -- and that, too, only maybe --

00:12:52.932 --> 00:12:54.808
will our region

00:12:54.832 --> 00:12:57.268
and other regions
that depend on our glaciers

00:12:57.292 --> 00:13:01.855
have any chance to avoid
major catastrophes.